  {
    "name": "designos_apply_spec",
    "description": "Build a complete UI subtree from a declarative NodeSpec (supports EaseUI BrainWave 2.0 presets like easeui-screen/easeui-card/easeui-button-primary, $easeui.* tokens, and Auto-Layout 5.0 row/column/wrap/hug/fill) in a single atomic undoable step together with the variables it creates. Replies with bindings_created, styles_linked and warnings (for example DEPRECATED_EASEUI_TOKEN). Content added to, removed from or moved in an instance slot is kept when the main component changes.\n\nExamples:\n1) Token-bound frame with auto-layout:\n{\"parent_id\":1,\"spec\":{\"kind\":\"frame\",\"name\":\"Hero\",\"layout\":{\"direction\":\"column\",\"gap\":16,\"padding\":[24,24,24,24]},\"fill\":\"var:Color/Surface\",\"children\":[{\"kind\":\"text\",\"name\":\"Title\",\"text\":\"Welcome\"}]}}\n2) Component instance with variant and overrides:\n{\"parent_id\":1,\"spec\":{\"kind\":\"instance\",\"name\":\"PrimaryCTA\",\"component\":\"Button\",\"variant\":{\"Size\":\"lg\",\"State\":\"default\"},\"overrides\":[{\"path\":\"Label\",\"text\":\"Continue\"}]}}\n3) Component instance with filled slots:\n{\"parent_id\":1,\"spec\":{\"kind\":\"instance\",\"name\":\"SettingsCard\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"slots\":{\"header\":[{\"kind\":\"instance\",\"component\":\"CardHeader\"}],\"body\":[{\"kind\":\"instance\",\"component\":\"FormRow\"}],\"footer\":false}}}",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "diff_image": {
          "default": false,
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "lint": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "enum": [
                "preset",
                "errors_only",
                "off"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Optional per-call lint override (false or 'off' skips the per-call lint pass)."
        },
        "parent_id": {
          "description": "DesignOS numeric node ID; obtain from list_nodes/get_document.",
          "minimum": 1,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "spec": {
          "description": "Declarative NodeSpec tree (kind, name, preset, width, height, width_sizing, height_sizing, fill, stroke, corner_radius, text, font_size, layout, dev_status, annotations, children).",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "spec"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": true,
      "idempotentHint": false,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": false
    }
  },
